# START HERE (Genesis development)

Forked to start a project? Read `GENESIS.md` first — the rules below are for
developing Genesis itself.

All rules live in root `AGENTS.md`; read it, then `docs/memory/` (context →
progress → decisions). The product ships from `templates/` — any change there
needs a `CHANGELOG.md` entry.

**Always on:** follow `templates/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md` (write the least
code that works). End of session: update `docs/memory/progress.md`. Never
commit unless asked.
